  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : Roots are $\\omega, \\omega^2$\nLet $\\alpha=\\omega, \\beta=\\omega^2$ $\\alpha^{19}=\\omega, \\beta^7=\\omega^2$\n$\\therefore$ Equation remains same i.e. $\\mathrm{x}^2+\\mathrm{x}+1=0$",
